  pwglex:differentia "Sub-sense δ) covers compounds with the participle gata- used to denote 'having gone into / being situated in X' (position) or 'having joined X' (association); the two surviving glosses illustrate these two nuances — association ('присоединился к V.') vs. static position ('сидящий, стоящий в колеснице')."@ru ;
