  pwglex:differentia "German gives four semicolon-separated near-synonym groups for upa-gam: (1) hinzukommen 'приходить, присоединяться' — mere addition/joining; (2) herankommen an / hinzutreten zu / an einen Ort hingehen / gelangen zu 'подходить к, приступать к, идти куда-л., достигать' — directed approach/arrival at a place; (3) besuchen 'посещать' — visiting with purpose; (4) erreichen, treffen 'достигать, встречать' — reaching/meeting. Kept as separate semicolon-bound clusters per the source punctuation rule (comma = interchangeable within a cluster, semicolon = boundary between distinct nuances)."@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:machine-preview ;
  pwglex:model "claude-sonnet-5" ;
  prov:generatedAtTime "2026-07-03T16:34:44Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
