  pwglex:differentia "German comma groups weggehen with the departure-sense (уходить, corpus-attested «уйти/удалиться»); semicolon then opens the fading/vanishing sub-sense (проходить, исчезать), rendered by two near-synonyms of equal cardinality per Hartmann & James / Apresjan cardinality rule."@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:machine-preview ;
  pwglex:model "claude-sonnet-5" ;
